{"id":"iniciar-documento-html","title":"Iniciar documento Html","topic":"html","topicLabel":"HTML","tags":["aprendizaje","Html"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":1,"text":"Iniciar documento","id":"iniciar-documento"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":0.5,"words":68,"html":"<h1 id=\"iniciar-documento\" class=\"note__h note__h--1\">Iniciar documento</h1><h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Siempre hay que poner el comando DOCTYPE al inicio de cada pagina Html, junto con las etiquetas body, head y html.\nhtml: es para todo el documento\nhead: informacion interna y metadatos\nbody: la estructura y contenido</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">&lt;!DOCTYPE <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">html</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">html</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">lang</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;es&quot;</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">meta</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">charset</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;UTF-8&quot;</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span>Mi primer documento web<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>Hola, mundo<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>Esta es mi primera página web.<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">html</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div>"}